        "transformation": "32 days (c. 2), 30 for the first 3 years of service (cc. 3-4: 'Dopo 3 anni di servizio, a qualsiasi titolo prestato'). The CCNL counts the three years in any public administration ('a qualsiasi titolo prestato' / 'presso una qualsiasi pubblica amministrazione'); the tiers read the seniority with this employer, so a worker with earlier public service gets 26 (30) days when the text gives 28 (32): state the seniority with the earlier public service included."
      }
